./ I 00391000 $ 00391100 100                                                    
VMESA390 EQU   X'02'          VMFSTAT: ESA/390 MACHINE         XA0054DK         
         TM    VMFSTAT,VMESA390  M7: ESA/390 GUEST IN HOME     XA0054DK         
         BZ    PRVLGH         MODE: THE INSTRUCTION IS IN      XA0054DK         
         TM    PROPSW+2,X'C0' THE HOME SPACE (EXTSHCR1 IS      XA0054DK         
         BNO   PRVLGH         ITS SHADOW THEN, DMKVAX)         XA0054DK         
         L     R1,VMECEXT                                      XA0054DK         
         LCTL  C1,C1,EXTSHCR1-ECBLOK(R1)                       XA0054DK         
PRVLGH   DS    0H                                              XA0054DK         
